entry.content:
check_domain: inputSchema  parameters: -Also +Send -"domain"; +name or domain;
dig: description, inputSchema  +resolver on the -resolver, +(the resolvers isitdns monitors),  parameters: -Also +Send -"domain"; +name or domain;
dnssec_chain: description, inputSchema  -answer: +answer for a validation failure or key change: -the +that insecure -where it goes insecure -key +DNSKEY +that -would rest +depends +is read  parameters: -Also +Send -"domain"; +name or domain;
registration: description, inputSchema  +whether -domain's registration +domain is expired or on hold  parameters: -Also +Send -"name"; +name or domain;
sweep_domain: inputSchema  parameters: -Also +Send -"name"; +name or domain;
trace: inputSchema  parameters: -Also +Send -"domain"; +name or domain;

taifoon_buy: description, inputSchema  +mcp.digest, sold per call by Taifoon at 0.0012 USDC (x402); risk.address, sold per call by Taifoon at 0.0012 USDC (x402);  parameters: -["agent.directory", +["mcp.digest", "risk.address", "agent.directory", -["agent.directory"] +["mcp.digest"]
taifoon_grid: description  -inference through the metered GPU gate, +chat completion -key; +key, paid from its balance, on any model of GET /v1/models (endpoint route) or a GPU lane;
introduced -- taifoon_buy: price
